# BC250 category: task
# Ollama model: task-lfm25-1.2b-instruct-liquidai-q6-k
# Source: LiquidAI/LFM2.5-1.2B-Instruct-GGUF @ main
# GGUF: LFM2.5-1.2B-Instruct-Q6_K.gguf
# SHA256: c5e895c191a066f6b26a8f09f10e94cdb799e579216f87df61a7e27beacd9a2b
# License: LFM1.0
# Role: default compact Open WebUI title/tag/retrieval-query task model.
#
# Real-device evidence, 2026-09-12:
# - 15/18 direct task qualification (5/6 in each of three rounds).
# - 15/18 through the real Open WebUI task endpoints when package-owned task
#   prompt templates were applied.
# - 9/9 successful true-overlap trials while GPT-OSS remained warm/resident;
#   no additional swap growth and no OOM/GPU/device-reset warnings.
# - Known residual: the French-title fixture remains a relevance miss.
#
# Deliberately no fixed SYSTEM prompt. Open WebUI supplies a different package-
# owned prompt for title, tags, and retrieval-query generation. A generic SYSTEM
# prompt was tested and reduced reliability by priming multiple task shapes.

FROM /var/lib/bc250-llm-server/gguf/task/LFM2.5-1.2B-Instruct-Q6_K.gguf

PARAMETER num_gpu 99
PARAMETER num_keep 256
PARAMETER num_ctx 4096
PARAMETER num_predict 128
PARAMETER temperature 0.1
PARAMETER top_k 50
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.05
